{{Guide|Link = [[Orokin Cell Farming Guide]]}}
{{Navigation|Orokin Cell|Orokin Cell Farming Guide}}
{{ResourceInfobox}}
{{Quote|Ancient energy cell from the Orokin era.|In-Game Description}}
An {{Resource|Orokin Cell}} is a rare [[resource]] that can be found on [[Saturn]], [[Ceres]], and [[Deimos]]. It is usually found in quantities of 1-2. 

All bosses (including the [[Stalker]]) have a chance to drop an {{Resource|Orokin Cell}} after being defeated, as do Sentient enemies.

==Acquisition==
===Market===
{{Quote|By purchasing this item you can directly exchange {{pc|10}} for 1 Orokin Cell.|In-Game Description}}
Orokin Cells can be purchased directly from the market for {{pc|10}}, or as a reusable blueprint for {{pc|100}}.
